<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"WorkPractice/=E5=B7=A5=E4=BD=9C=E6=8C=87=E5=BC=95-Ticketmanagemen=
t">Ticket management</h2>
<p>a. code changes need branch</p>
<p>b. branch need ticket number</p>
<p>c. ticket should all create by PM(email,slack)</p>
<p>d. big ticket, like push notification/merchant, during development, we c=
ould create sub-ticket, to separate sub-feature under the big feature</p>
<h2 id=3D"WorkPractice/=E5=B7=A5=E4=BD=9C=E6=8C=87=E5=BC=95-Branchmanagemen=
t">Branch management</h2>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://hongkongtv.atlassian.net/proj=
ects/MA?selectedItem=3Dcom.atlassian.jira.jira-projects-plugin%3Arelease-pa=
ge" rel=3D"nofollow">https://hongkongtv.atlassian.net/projects/MA?selectedI=
tem=3Dcom.atlassian.jira.jira-projects-plugin%3Arelease-page</a></p>
<p>ticket lifecycle: from Open to closed;</p>
<p>after the version released, then new ticket as previous ticket closed;</=
p>
<p>during UAT, all fixed should fix on the feature branch;</p>
<h2 id=3D"WorkPractice/=E5=B7=A5=E4=BD=9C=E6=8C=87=E5=BC=95-UATbuildversion=
practice">UAT build version practice</h2>
<p>During UAT, after fixed issues in the version, send slack in channel;</p=
>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">version=
: 1.0.1
title: fix login crash
ticket:</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>then we could know during the day, we have fixed issue;</p>
<p>then in the dayend, 6pm build out an updated version for QA testing;</p>
    </div>
</body>
